### # 1. A perfume-seller or proprietor of a perfume business
<a id="term-1-a-perfume-seller-or-proprietor-of-a-perfume-business"></a>

Overview: [back to tools.md](./tools.md#term-1-a-perfume-seller-or-proprietor-of-a-perfume-business)

