Relevance: `non_perfume`

2.

##### Theophrastus, *Fragmenta* 4.41.
<a id="cit-1-fundamentally-alabastron-denotes-an-alabaster-flask-especially-a-smooth-vessel-used-for-perfume-or-ointment-in-the-supplied-technical-passages-that-basic-sense-develops-in-three-main-directions-first-the-pharmacological-container-for-aromatic-substances-second-the-stone-material-itself-valued-for-its-cold-dense-scent-preserving-properties-and-then-used-as-a-medicinal-ingredient-and-third-in-alchemy-a-coded-or-symbolic-white-mineral-substance-sometimes-also-an-image-for-the-purified-white-vessel-or-body-for-semantic-isolation-here-the-relevant-field-excludes-the-geographical-and-metrological-occurrences-and-keeps-the-medical-pharmacological-and-alchemical-uses-i-also-include-the-close-technical-derivatives-alabastrites-and-alabastroeides-because-they-make-the-specialized-sense-explicit-cit-1"></a>

Source class: `appendix_context`
Usage type: `unknown`

**Greek**

> «διὸ καὶ εἰς ἀγγεῖα μολυβδᾶ ἐγχέουσι καὶ τοὺς ἀλαβάστρους ζητοῦσι τοιούτου λίθου· ψυχρὸν γὰρ καὶ πυκνὸν … Ὥστε δι' ἄμφω τηροῦσι, καὶ τῷ ψυχρῷ καὶ τῷ πυκνῷ, μήτε διιέντες ἔξω τὴν ὀσμὴν…»

**Translation**

> “That is why they pour the perfumes into lead containers and seek alabastra made from such stone; for both lead and such stone are cold and dense … Thus they preserve them by both qualities, coldness and density, not letting the scent escape outward…”

Reference: Theophrastus, *Fragmenta* 4.41.

Context note: 2.

##### Ctesias, *Fragmenta* 45.47.
<a id="cit-1-fundamentally-alabastron-denotes-an-alabaster-flask-especially-a-smooth-vessel-used-for-perfume-or-ointment-in-the-supplied-technical-passages-that-basic-sense-develops-in-three-main-directions-first-the-pharmacological-container-for-aromatic-substances-second-the-stone-material-itself-valued-for-its-cold-dense-scent-preserving-properties-and-then-used-as-a-medicinal-ingredient-and-third-in-alchemy-a-coded-or-symbolic-white-mineral-substance-sometimes-also-an-image-for-the-purified-white-vessel-or-body-for-semantic-isolation-here-the-relevant-field-excludes-the-geographical-and-metrological-occurrences-and-keeps-the-medical-pharmacological-and-alchemical-uses-i-also-include-the-close-technical-derivatives-alabastrites-and-alabastroeides-because-they-make-the-specialized-sense-explicit-cit-2"></a>

