### # 3. By metaphor, a repository of varied and useful material
<a id="term-3-by-metaphor-a-repository-of-varied-and-useful-material"></a>

Overview: [back to tools.md](./tools.md#term-3-by-metaphor-a-repository-of-varied-and-useful-material)

