### # Clinical Observation of Mental Pathology (Psychiatric / Medical)
<a id="term-clinical-observation-of-mental-pathology-psychiatric-medical"></a>

Overview: [back to tools.md](./tools.md#term-clinical-observation-of-mental-pathology-psychiatric-medical)

